1
00:00:03,460 --> 00:00:06,020
(Raj:)I'm telling you, if xenon emits
ultraviolet light,

2
00:00:06,020 --> 00:00:08,430
(Raj:)then those dark matter
discoveries must be wrong.

3
00:00:08,430 --> 00:00:10,430
(Sheldon:)Yes, well, if we lived
in a world

4
00:00:10,430 --> 00:00:12,460
(Sheldon:)where slow-moving xenon
produced light,

5
00:00:12,460 --> 00:00:13,700
(Sheldon:)then you'd be correct.

6
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:15,230
(Sheldon:)Also, pigs would fly,

7
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:17,070
(Sheldon:)my derriere would produce
cotton candy,

8
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:20,670
and The Phantom Menace
would be a timeless classic.

9
00:00:20,670 --> 00:00:21,870
(Raj:)Oh, you're so arrogant.

10
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:23,170
(Raj:)If you were a superhero,

11
00:00:23,170 --> 00:00:24,940
(Raj:)your name would be
Captain Arrogant.

12
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:27,110
(Raj:)And you know
what your superpower would be?

13
00:00:27,110 --> 00:00:28,610
(Raj:)Arrogance.

14
00:00:28,610 --> 00:00:30,880
(Sheldon:)You're wrong again.

15
00:00:30,880 --> 00:00:36,720
(Sheldon:)If my superpower were arrogance,
my name would be Dr. Arroganto.

16
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:39,860
(Howard(laughs):)I love watching Raj and Sheldon
try to work together.

17
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,860
(Leonard:)Yeah, it's like
if Alien and Predator decided

18
00:00:41,860 --> 00:00:45,300
(Leonard:)to go partners
in a Jamba Juice.

19
00:00:45,300 --> 00:00:47,160
(Raj:)Has it occurred to you
you're missing the big picture?

20
00:00:47,170 --> 00:00:49,270
(Raj:)If you look at neutron
scattering data...
Oh, Penny?

21
00:00:49,270 --> 00:00:50,330
(Sheldon:)Penny?
What's up?

22
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:52,140
(Sheldon:)Nothing. I just wanted

23
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:54,400
(Sheldon:)to make Raj stop talking.

24
00:00:54,410 --> 00:00:56,310
(Howard(after Raj whispers to him):)No, no, no.

25
00:00:56,310 --> 00:00:57,980
(Howard(after Raj whispers to him):)He won. Suck it up.

26
00:00:57,980 --> 00:01:00,410
(Penny:)Well, I'd ask you guys
if you want dessert,

27
00:01:00,410 --> 00:01:02,610
(Penny:)but I know Sheldon doesn't
eat dessert on Tuesdays.

